# P3 mc2_01 win: all actions are physical HUD hotkeys or mouse clicks on the map.
# Coordinates are for the production 800x600 logical HUD. The tactical-map rect is
# x=4..165, y=435..596; right-clicks issue moves in the shipped Left/Right (AOE)
# mouse profile. Each left-click first centres the camera on the named target; D then
# selects Default Attack range and a right-click release at world-screen centre attacks it.
# This file never calls the sim directly.
#
# 1. The opening ABL camera/movie sequence runs before normal mission input.
# Wait 90 seconds, centre the camera on the three player mechs, then Select Visible.
# This is a real map click followed by the HUD hotkey, not an injected selection.
2700 move 116 540
2701 button left down
2702 button left up
2730 tap E

